  "description": "Harbor House brings you GMO in a convenient 1g pre-roll, ready to deliver a powerful and memorable experience. This premium preroll showcases the distinctive garlic, earthy, and pungent aroma that GMO is celebrated for, offering a robust flavor profile that stands out from the crowd. Known for its relaxing and euphoric effects, this strain is perfect for unwinding after a long day or melting away stress. Each pre-roll is expertly crafted for smooth, consistent burning and maximum enjoyment. Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast or exploring new favorites, Harbor House's GMO pre-roll provides quality and potency in every puff. Elevate your cannabis ritual with this bold, flavorful choice that delivers satisfaction from start to finish.",
